{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "Dk7kk7vV2A", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Tom Brokaw (Democratic National Convention in Boston)", "segment_description": "NOTE - Local weather bulletin on screen from 5:52:10 to 5:56:50.", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760708, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "y7LwS06g9n", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "Decision 2004 / Democratic Convention / Clinton Interview", "segment_description": "(Boston: Tom Brokaw) The opening of the Democratic National Convention in Boston noted. \n (Convention floor: Brian Williams) The convention featured; details given of the Democrats\u2019 aim for a positive message, with the focus on introducing Senator John Kerry to the public, and of an incident involving an exchange between Kerry\u2019s wife and a reporter; scenes shown of Kerry touring NASA in Cape Canaveral, Florida, and at a baseball game in Boston; photos shown of Senator John Edwards working on his convention speech. [Democratic National Committee chairman Terry McAULIFFE&#134;- campaigns for Kerry & Edwards.] [KERRY \u2013defends his wife.] [Wife Teresa HEINZ KERRY \u2013 tells a reporter to \u201cshove it.\u201d] [DELEGATE \u2013 comments.] [Senator Edward KENNEDY \u2013 sings.] Security at the convention and the \u201cbounce\u201d in the polls noted. \n (Boston: Tom Brokaw) Vice President Dick Cheney\u2019s campaign trip to the Pacific Northwest noted; scenes shown from Kennewick, Washington. [CHENEY \u2013 says we need the same, steadfast presidential leadership.] \n (Boston: Lisa Myers) The lavish parties thrown by corporations & special interest groups to channel money to politicians examined; scenes shown of former presidential candidate Howard Dean dancing at a party paid for by Johnson & Johnson, of the Neville brothers singing at an extravaganza hosted by 30 companies, and other events. [Campaign finance reform advocate Fred WERTHEIMER&#134;- says it\u2019s 24/7 partying paid for by the special interests.] [June 15, KERRY \u2013 speaks of \u201cspecial privilege for none.\u201d] [Democratic donor John CATSIMATIDES&#134;- comments on the discriminatory way of deciding who gets invited to the parties.] [Senator Harry REID&#134;&#134;- defends a lunch sponsored by gambling & mining companies.] \n (Boston: Tom Brokaw) Interview held with former President Bill Clinton about the presidential campaign and the 9/11 Commission\u2019s report. [CLINTON \u2013 explains what Kerry must accomplish during the convention; comments on the impact of his previous behavior on Kerry\u2019s campaign; offers his view on the two great issues of this campaign: domestic policy & the 9/11 report; says he had confidence in the CIA & former director George Tenet when he was president; comments on the situation in Iraq.] Clinton\u2019s comments on the investigation involving his National Security Advisor Sandy Berger noted.", "segment_duration": 730, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760709, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "h4b4l20Jvm", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Boston: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63780.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760710, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "2cPff55CVS", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Cheez-It; Ensure; Crest Whitestrips; Nexium; \"Today\"; \"Dateline.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63800.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760711, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "uONy7lztcG", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "In Depth (9/11 Commission Final Report)", "segment_description": "(Boston: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (Washington: Pete Williams) President Bush\u2019s response to political & public pressure to adopt the recommendations of the commission that investigated the September 11 attacks featured; details given about the likelihood that Bush will adopt many of the recommendations by executive order. [Vice President Dick CHENEY \u2013 says we\u2019re at the beginning of what should be a great debate.] [Former President Bill CLINTON \u2013 praises the administration\u2019s steps.] [Terrorism expert Larry JOHNSON \u2013 supports the recommendation for a national counterterrorism center.] [Former CIA general counsel Jeff SMITH \u2013 warns against moving too quickly in establishing a director of intelligence.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63940.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760712, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1740, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760708, "segment_id": "aoW4Me8Eah", "segment_broadcast_id": "XivhgwA8xD", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Boston: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64080.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760713, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast